      "message": "`PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_DP_MODE` depends on `PLATFORM_EC_USB_POWER_DELIVERY` which depends on choosing `PLATFORM_EC_USBC_STACK` as `PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPMV2`.\n\n`PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TBT_COMPAT_MODE` depends on `PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_REV30` which depends on `PLATFORM_EC_USB_POWER_DELIVERY` which depends on choosing `PLATFORM_EC_USBC_STACK` as `PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPMV2`.",
