      "writtenOn": "2024-02-09T16:03:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regarding setting `usb_mux_set` based on `status.data_conn`,  that\u0027s probably the correct behavior. If data_conn isn\u0027t set by the PDC, we have to assume the USB signals are not connected.\n\nRegarding the Kconfigs, Brox has the USBC related configs set as follows.  `PLATFOFRM_EC_USB_POWER_DELIVERY` is not present. \n\nIt looks like Deepti landed a fix to allow the TBT, REV30, USB4 configs when `PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_CONTROLLER` is present.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/zephyr/Kconfig.usbc_common_altmode;l\u003d5\n\n```\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USBC\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USBC_RETIMER_ANX7451 is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USBC_RETIMER_KB800X is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CONSOLE_CMD_RETIMER is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USBC_RETIMER_PS8811 is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_VBUS_MEASURE_NOT_PRESENT\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_VBUS_MEASURE_CHARGER is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_VBUS_MEASURE_TCPC is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_VBUS_MEASURE_ADC_EACH_PORT is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_VBUS_MEASURE_BY_BOARD is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CMD_VBUS is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_HOST_CMD\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_PD_CONTROL is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_LOGGING is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_PD_CHIP_INFO\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_RWHASHPD\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_TYPEC_DISCOVERY\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_TYPEC_CONTROL\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_TYPEC_STATUS\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_TASK\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_AP_CONTROL is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_TUSB_NONE\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_TUSB546 is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_TUSB1044 is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_TUSB1064 is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USBC_SS_MUX\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_RUNTIME_CONFIG\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USBC_SS_MUX_DFP_ONLY is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_MUX_VIRTUAL\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USBC_RETIMER_FW_UPDATE is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CONSOLE_CMD_TYPEC\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_DP_MODE\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_REV30\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TBT_COMPAT_MODE\u003dy\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_USB4\u003dy\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_CHARGER is not set\n# CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPMV2 is not set\nCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_CONTROLLER\u003dy\n```",
