      "message": "\u003e Should there be a connection between emul_intel_pd_controller and emul_pdc to handle this? This way when emul_intel_pd_controller_connect_data is called, it will notify emul_pdc.\n\nThat\u0027s probably a good idea, but is it needed for this test?  I thought you were asking if `pd_task_intel_altmode.c` should change to do the following:\n\n```\n\tusb_mux_set(port, mux,\n\t\t    status_data.conn ? USB_SWITCH_DISCONNECT :\n\t\t\t\t\t     USB_SWITCH_CONNECT,\n\t\t    status.conn_ori);\n```",
