      "writtenOn": "2024-02-23T01:56:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using `status_data.conn` for setting `usb_mode` (`USB_SWITCH_CONNECT` or `USB_SWITCH_DISCONNECT`) does not make any difference in `pd_is_connected` result. `usb_mode` is only used to decide whether to enter in low power mode.\n\nIf we want to evaluate `pd_is_connected` in this test, we need to either connect `emul_intel_pd_controller` with `emul_pdc`, or manipulate `emul_pdc_rts54`.\n\nCould we unblock these CL\u0027s, by removing `pd_is_connected` evaluation, and we address handling connection in a separate tracker?",
